    "created_at": "2018-06-20T11:18:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-20T11:18:54Z",
    "body": "Would resolve https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/123. @upsuper @winstonchen @jernoble, do you have thoughts about the naming/semantics here?\r\n\r\nGiven a variety of default behaviors currently, does the default have to be \"auto\" or something which means neither \"will show navigator bar\" nor \"will not show navigation bar\"?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/comments/398714541/reactions",
