    "created_at": "2018-08-24T04:37:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-24T04:37:39Z",
    "body": "Hmm, above @foolip is saying there may or may not be a navigation bar and @jernoble was trying to avoid saying navigation bar altogether. `minimalUI = false` as a default strikes me as a better choice.\r\n\r\nOr perhaps we can match `window.open()` terminology here? cc @zcorpan ",
